# Witness: a decoy decision section above the real one

This is the shape of a false approval that a first-match section lookup cannot see. The decoy
above ticks PENDING, so the rule reads one ticked box, decides the record is pending, and never
looks at the attestation - while the section a reader sees records APPROVED FOR PREVIEW over
four unsigned fields.

## Decision vocabulary

- [x] **PENDING** - the shape of a ticked entry.

## 9. Decision

- [x] **APPROVED FOR PREVIEW** within the intended-use scope above.
- [ ] **APPROVED WITH CONDITIONS** listed below.
- [ ] **NOT APPROVED.**
- [ ] **PENDING** - not yet reviewed.

## 11. Human Attestation

- **Name:** _not yet signed_
- **Reviewer alias:** _not yet signed_
- **Signature or attributable commit:** _not yet signed_
- **Date:** _not yet signed_
